flowchart TB
  R[Queued live or archive replay run] --> S[2.1 Search and persist actual scene metadata]
  S <--> P[Ordered provider failover and disk cache]
  S --> C[2.2 Read AOI SCL and select new usable later scene]
  C --> B[2.3 Select older baseline; extend search if needed]
  B --> REF[2.4 Seek same-season reference from last year]
  REF --> A[2.5 Align six bands and buffered valid masks]
  A --> M{Change checkpoint available?}
  M -- Yes --> ML[2.6 Siamese probability and spectral fusion]
  M -- No --> SP[2.6 Labelled spectral change fallback]
  ML --> REG[2.7 Morphology and connected regions]
  SP --> REG
  A --> LC[2.8 Land-cover U-Net or labelled spectral classes]
  LC --> CAUSE[2.9 Ordered cause rules]
  REG --> CAUSE
  CTX[Optional rain, disasters, OSM and slope] --> CAUSE
  CAUSE --> SEAS[2.10 Same-season persistence test or unknown]
  SEAS --> AUTH[2.11 Verdict and date-type-overlap zone check]
  Z[(Local authorised zones)] --> AUTH
  AUTH --> E[(Case, findings, evidence and reasons)]
  E --> EL[2.12 Apply score and category filters; merge repeated regions]
  EL --> DIS[2.13 Dispatch new eligible alerts; retain seasonal evidence without alert]
  S -. provider failure or no usable pair .-> END[Persist truthful terminal run state]
  REG -. no retained change .-> END
